comaps (2026.10.01+pro1x1) daedalus; urgency=medium

  * Positions from gpsd where it runs, geoclue2 otherwise (the F(x)tec Pro1X
    feeds its modem's GNSS to gpsd).
  * Two-finger gestures follow the fingers by id: pinch zoom on X11, where a
    second finger arrives first in Qt's list of points.
  * Builds on daedalus (Qt 6.4, boost 1.81) as well; depends on Leste's Qt6
    platform and style plugins, which the Hildon session loads; the menu entry
    is also below applications/hildon.

 -- Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>  Mon, 26 Oct 2026 17:09:48 +0100

